# Internal review documents. Kept out of git deliberately: this repository is
# public, and these describe the deployment's weak points, including how an
# unauthenticated endpoint could be abused and the fact that development and
# production currently share one database. Fixed code is safe to publish; a map
# of what was weak, and of what is still open, is not. Keep them locally, or
# move them somewhere private and share the link.
docs/AUDIT_2026_10_15.md
docs/PRODUCTION_LAUNCH_PLAN.md
docs/PROD_DB_SETUP.md
docs/HOSTINGER_GO_LIVE.md

# Build artefact from scripts/make-deploy-zip.sh
villa-booking-deploy.zip
